sequenceDiagram
  participant E as Engineer
  participant S as SearchEngine
  participant L as Labeled queries
  participant M as Metrics
  E->>S: ingest corpus
  E->>L: define relevant ids
  loop each query
    L->>S: search(query, k)
    S-->>M: hits
    M->>M: recall@k, RR
  end
  M-->>E: EvalReport MRR / recall
